{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12245070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12245070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1224507001:1":{"text":"嘿！你果然在这。","source_cn":"嘿！你果然在这。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB92D5512200B555","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224507002:0":{"text":"有事快说，没事就滚。","source_cn":"有事快说，没事就滚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91EA0322CE1FDF38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1224507003:1":{"text":"心情不好？为了不能出海的事情？","source_cn":"心情不好？为了不能出海的事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE6617596A13AD64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224507004:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224507005:1":{"text":"你这人太奇怪了，明明是你自己拒绝了，却像是被拒绝了一样伤心。","source_cn":"你这人太奇怪了，明明是你自己拒绝了，却像是被拒绝了一样伤心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4784F9CA55D024D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224507006:1":{"text":"是啊，我也搞不懂我自己。","source_cn":"是啊，我也搞不懂我自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02139B6B453A5B6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224507007:1":{"text":"瞧瞧，这是什么？","source_cn":"瞧瞧，这是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB9A8E9EDA783D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:9::2":{"text":"罗盘","source_cn":"罗盘","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39BF68A0B410B505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224507008:1":{"text":"你从海上回来的第一天就拿着它在我眼前晃过一次了。","source_cn":"你从海上回来的第一天就拿着它在我眼前晃过一次了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D115422F804DE22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224507009:1":{"text":"记得很清楚嘛。那当年是谁说要当我的大副，现在却这个德行？","source_cn":"记得很清楚嘛。那当年是谁说要当我的大副，现在却这个德行？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84BB93054B3F1870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224507010:1":{"text":"那已经是过去了，我现在不想航海。","source_cn":"那已经是过去了，我现在不想航海。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F8D35322FDD73D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224507011:1":{"text":"……我说，你该放下了吧？","source_cn":"……我说，你该放下了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AE7BDEDB602D1B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1224507012:1":{"text":"泰西欧已经受到了审判，血薇帮也证明了老爹他们的清白。","source_cn":"泰西欧已经受到了审判，血薇帮也证明了老爹他们的清白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E07ED88FA8B3807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224507013:1":{"text":"虽然你和我的父亲都不会再回来了，但为自己热爱的事业奉献出生命……反正我老爹肯定没有怨言。","source_cn":"虽然你和我的父亲都不会再回来了，但为自己热爱的事业奉献...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9D12D3431F055DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1224507014:1":{"text":"出航的水手死在海里——这事太常见了，你父亲肯定和你打过预防针。","source_cn":"出航的水手死在海里——这事太常见了，你父亲肯定和你打过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D284EEF02E6A8DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1224507015:1":{"text":"你只是不能接受他不是死在航海冒险上，而是被一个小人所害。","source_cn":"你只是不能接受他不是死在航海冒险上，而是被一个小人所害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ED0BCA4E53B81E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:122450